`seg_tombDead_mp`, `seg_sound_halt_mp`, **`seg_sound_c_mp`**, **`seg_sound_any_mp`**: the statements of CORE's `seg_tombDead`, `seg_sound_halt`, `seg_sound_c`, `seg_sound_any` with `HoldsX (wasmBaseSegAirMP …)` and `ChipIf compressW (wasmBaseSegAirMP …)`; each is its `HoldsXS` version (`Main/SegS/*.lean`) applied to `HoldsX.toSMP` / `SegSha.ChipIf.toSMP`.  Generated by `gen/segS/gen_mp.py`.
